# ROG Phone 5 (SM8350) build: Arch Linux packaging mutter 50.5-1, but the
# source is GNOME Shell Mobile's mutter (World/MobileShell/mutter-mobile,
# branch camelCaseNick/mobile-shell-devel-50, 50.3 based) with GNOME 50.5
# merged in (0001), the upstream 51 auto-rotate fix for phones (0002), the
# version that gnome-shell-mobile requires (0003) and a stray conflict marker
# in a test file removed (0004). Opt-in only; it replaces mutter.
# See ../README.md. Not in configs/rootfs/custom-packages.txt on purpose.

pkgname=mutter-mobile
# camelCaseNick/mobile-shell-devel-50, 2026-09-27: mobile-shell-devel-50
# (c99af8f4) rebased with the fixes that make clutter compile, plus OSK
# events during popups and the window mapped state. c99af8f4 itself does not
# compile (clutter-gesture.c half-ported to sprites, a stray conflict marker).
